## 🚪 Redirect-Policy (automatisch via Middleware)

### Wenn User **eingeloggt**

| Route | Redirect |
|-------|----------|
| / | → /dashboard |
| /login | → /dashboard |
| /regist | → /dashboard |
| /basic, /pro, etc. | → /dashboard |

### Wenn User **NICHT** eingeloggt

| Route | Redirect |
|-------|----------|
| /dashboard | → /login?next=/dashboard |
| /agents/* | → /login?next=/agents/...  |
| /billing | → /login?next=/billing |

### Wenn Trial **abgelaufen**

| Route | Redirect |
|-------|----------|
| **ALLE** (außer /billing) | → /billing |

